# Abundance: "If your library is empty, Abundance can prevent you from losing the game for being unable to draw a card ...
# you'll never be forced to draw a card with an empty library" (its ruling; CR 121.6a, 704.5b). Bot1's whole deck is in
# its opening hand. Its turn 3 draw for the turn would be from the empty library; Bot1 takes Abundance's effect instead,
